ode6.irmos:
Cleanse me, O Savior,
for many are mine iniquities;
lead me up from the abyss of evils I pray Thee,
for unto Thee have I cried,
and Thou hast hearkened unto me,//
O God of my salvation.

ode6.irmos2:
From within the sea monster Jonah cried unto the Lord:
Lead me up from the abyss of Hades, I pray Thee;
for with a voice of praise as to my Redeemer,
in the spirit of truth//
I offer myself to Thee.
